year: 1860
attribution: Words and music by Ivan Petrovich Larionov (1830-1889), written in 1860 for a Saratov theatre production; public domain. The slow verse ("Akh, pod sosnoyu") is written at the same tempo with its original note values.
tags: russia, dance, folk, balalaika

